    <shortDescription>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Centro is seeking an experienced and proactive Project Manager (PMP-certified) to lead and deliver high-impact projects in the Business Process Outsourcing (BPO) sector. Reporting to the Head of PM, you will oversee project lifecycles from planning to execution, ensuring alignment with business objectives, driving process improvements, and maintaining compliance standards. The ideal candidate is a dynamic leader with a track record of managing complex projects, collaborating with diverse stakeholders, and optimizing operational efficiency in a fast-paced environment.]]></Value>
